# Nothing in this file is read by the build or the app.
#
# AI Open Pocket bundles NO provider key into any build (debug included): you enter your own Meta Model
# API key in the app, in onboarding or in Settings. Get one at https://dev.meta.ai/docs/quickstart
# The key is stored encrypted on the phone and goes only to https://api.meta.ai/v1.
#
# This file is kept as an empty template for local tooling. Do not put live keys in .env expecting
# them to reach the app: they will not (tools/check.py would flag a key found in the APK).
